Target & Model & Attack recall & Margin\\\hline
bluetooth & local-only & 0.228 & -0.567\\
bluetooth & fedavg & 0.981 & -0.019\\
bluetooth & fedper & 0.836 & -0.149\\
bluetooth & cluster-fl & 0.449 & 0.328\\
mqtt & local-only & 0.449 & 0.430\\
